Subject: [PATCH] ctrl: an SSID change refused while a configuration is in flight

A set_ssid taken while the radios were still in the WSC of an earlier change (em_config) was
taken into the controller's model but sent no renew: the radios already in their WSC counted as
done for it and kept the SSID their M2 carried, so the agents and the controller disagreed until
a restart, the mismatch only logged. A set_ssid is now refused with Error_Prev_Cmd_In_Progress
while a set_ssid, an em_config or a cfg_renew is active, and the caller tries again.

Platform-independent.

Upstream-Status: Pending

